Copyright (C) 2026 Vic20-Ian

k084: Konami 084 custom chip (starfield generator + watchdog, Tutankham KT-3203-1B PCB), written by Vic20-Ian
for the Rodimus MiSTer cores (first used in Arcade-Tutankham, 2026-08-24). Reconstructed from the 084 pinout,
the Galaxian / Scramble star circuit as modelled in MAME tutankhm_v.cpp, and the Konami bootleg daughter-board
that replaced the chip.

